==Trivia==
* Ultor is a Latin word meaning "avenger".
* Despite the poll blog and newspost stating the ultor ring requires full completion of [[Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire]] to wear, this is not the case in-game, and players need only to have obtained one kill count of [[Vardorvis]] to wear it.

